WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.060
What's up everybody!

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:05.900
We are Pongfinity

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.600
We are super excited to announce

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.880
That we have just launched our first Pongfinity table tennis products!

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.400
In today's video we are going to show you this net

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.440
Which can turn almost anything into a table tennis table!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:20.340
And we also have our very own professional level Pongfinity ball!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.200
You can buy these from Pongfinity.store

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.860
And during the first 24 hours

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.700
We have got a special campaign for you guys

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.640
Where every single order gets a greeting card signed by all three of us

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.100
We are going to play a match using this net

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.140
Where every point will be on a different table

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.000
Let's go!

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.240
The cabinet!

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.000
You saved it!

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.680
I got like a side spin or something!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.600
Okay next up, a chopping board!

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.000
This looks pretty difficult!

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:04.920
Jackpot!

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.640
Straight in the eye!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.900
Sorry

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:09.120
Treasure chest

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.360
You got it!

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.340
Around the net!

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.520
Why did I have to go for the hard one?

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.220
I have got this

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.760
I have got this!

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:46.800
It's my point!

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.380
This is intense

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.540
Sorry!

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:05.480
Okay next is the oven tray!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.780
It's a good sound in this!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.840
Okay this table is a bit bigger!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.260
It hit the lower level

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.700
It went into the sink

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.860
Next up, the pot lid!

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:12.700
I like this

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.500
It's making it quite easy

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.160
Wait a second

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.240
Who won the point?

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.060
How did I manage to loose that?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.080
You were in control of the table

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.320
I have got the tray, I could do anything!

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.540
Okay, car roof!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.820
This is something I haven't tried before

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:45.960
It's in!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.720
I got it on!

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.920
I blocked it with my nose!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.260
I have to see the slow motion

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:54.980
It's in!

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.360
I got it on!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.980
Ok, I'll give you the point

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.240
The sea gull is cheering for me

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.280
Or me

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.660
I took the side spin

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.340
A window

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.440
Nice save

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:33.340
I'm moving you around

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.000
Got it with a lucky point

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.720
Can you handle the swaying?

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.080
Easily

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.120
I'm going to fishing

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.740
Okay good game!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.520
We had so much fun filming this

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.000
You guys have to get your own

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.780
from Pongfinity.store

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.980
We have been working really hard to make this happen

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:09.040
So hopefully you guys enjoy our products

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.000
Making an order will also be a big support to our channel

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.500
So head over to Pongfinity.store!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.680
Until next time!

